      "widgets_values": [
        "H3 → LTX experimental native ComfyUI bridge\nStage1: 640x640, 175 frames, complete H3 4-step draft. Upscale x1.6, convert, then LTX 3-step refinement at 1024x1024.\nStage2 uses the installed INT8 distilled LTX-2.5 model, not the official BF16 dev + LoRA recipe.\nInstall the released adapter and matching Conv VAE separately; see docs/H3_LTX_BRIDGE.md. Validated with --reserve-vram 3 (3 GB); avoid double reservation.\nKeep all seeds fixed for comparisons. Finish Media trims 177 internal frames to 175 and restores original H3 audio.\nSee docs/H3_LTX_BRIDGE.md."
